      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_12",
      "quote": "We stratified studies according to the methods used to identify people with asymptomatic SARS-CoV-2 infection and the study setting. To synthesise proportions from comparable studies, in terms of design and population, we used stratified random-effects meta-analysis.",
      "reason": "The text describes how studies were grouped for synthesis (stratified by methods of identification and study setting) and linked to the synthesis method (stratified random-effects meta-analysis)."
    },
